sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Patient as Patient / Receptionist
    participant System as Smart Hospital System (SHMS)

    Patient->>System: selectDepartmentAndDoctor(deptId, doctorId)
    activate System
    System-->>Patient: displayAvailableSlots(date, slotList)
    deactivate System

    Patient->>System: bookAppointmentSlot(patientId, doctorId, chosenSlot, date)
    activate System
    System->>System: verifySlotAvailability()
    System->>System: createAppointmentRecord()
    System-->>Patient: confirmAppointmentBooking(appointmentId, status="Confirmed")
    deactivate System
